	(descr "PHYTEC phyCORE-AM62x PCM-071 System on Module, 240 pins over two Samtec BTH-060-01-L-D-A-K-TR (2x60, 0.5 mm pitch, 5 mm stack height). Rows B A D C left to right, pin 1 at the bottom, right connector staggered 4.8 mm down. Placement and module outline from PHYTEC PCM-071_1573-1.dxf; land pattern from Samtec drawing BTH-XXX-XX-X-D-XX REV D. The two receptacles are a separate BOM line, LCSC C3646540 x2 -- see som.md. Courtyard covers the connectors only: the module stands 5 mm off the board, so parts may sit under it; the 32x43 mm outline is on F.Fab.")
